get.description:
Get all related entities for a given entity.

Query params:
- relationship_types: Comma-separated list (e.g., "customers,purchase_orders")

Returns:
{
  "entity": { "id": 123, "type": "customer", "name": "Acme Corp" },
  "relationships": {
    "purchase_orders": [
      { "id": 456, "type": "purchase_order", "title": "PO-001", "metadata": {...} }
    ],
    "sales_orders": [...],
    "contacts": [...]
  },
  "counts": {
    "purchase_orders": 15,
    "sales_orders": 8,
    "contacts": 3
  }
}

post.description:
Bulk deactivate multiple users.

Expected payload:
{
    "user_ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

Bulk update roles for multiple users.

Expected payload:
{
    "user_ids": [1, 2, 3],
    "role": "admin"
}

Bulk update multiple configurations.

Expected payload:
{
    "configurations": [
        {"id": "uuid1", "value": "new_value1"},
        {"id": "uuid2", "value": "new_value2"}
    ]
}

Reset all configurations in a category to default values.

Expected payload:
{
    "category": "security"
}

